ANTILLES (simulations 1..400)
---------------------------
The 400 tables are distributed in logPkRatio_antilles.zip; extracted .dat files
are ignored by Git. Commit the ZIP, ensure_antilles.py, this README and the core
.gitignore together. The 3Dx2D Makefile runs ensure_antilles.py before compilation
(and checks the tables even when binaries are already up to date).
Requires Python 3, with no third-party packages. Manual extraction/check:

    python3 logPkRatio/ensure_antilles.py       # from cosmolike_core

The helper restores missing or CRC-mismatched tables atomically, leaves matching
files untouched, and fails the build on a missing/invalid archive. To update the
tables, update the ZIP as well: the ZIP is the authoritative copy.

Each logPkRatio_antilles-N.dat corresponds to Cocoa antilles/logPkR/simN.
Each file has one header and 400 rows: log10(k [h/Mpc]), then 15 columns of
log10(P_hydro/P_DMO). Redshifts are recorded at full source precision in the header:
3, 2.75, 2.5, 2.25, 2, 1.75, 1.5, 1.25, 1, 0.75, 0.5,
0.37000000476837158, 0.25, 0.11999999731779099, 0.
